[l_braz_por]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=Infiltrar-se na Força Aérea
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=A força aérea [From.getAdjective] é a mais nova das forças armadas [From.GetAdjective]. Sendo assim, ela possui várias pessoas de passados incomuns. Podemos nos aproveitar disso para colocar um homem infiltrado.

[l_english]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=Infiltrate Air Force
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=§LThe [From.getAdjective] Air Force is the youngest of the [From.GetAdjective] armed forces. As such, it has in its ranks many people of unusual backgrounds. We could exploit some of them to get a man on the inside.§!

[l_french]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=Infiltrer l'armée de l'air
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=§LL'armée de l'air est la branche la plus récente de l'armée [From.GetAdjFS]. En tant que telle, elle compte dans ses rangs de nombreuses personnes au passé relativement inhabituel.\n   Nous pourrions tirer parti de ce contexte pour placer un agent parmi eux.§!

[l_german]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=Die Luftwaffe infiltrieren
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=§LDie [From.getAdjective]e Luftwaffe ist der jüngste Zweig der [From.GetAdjective]en Streitkräfte. In seinen Reihen befinden sich daher viele Menschen mit ungewöhnlichem Hintergrund. Das könnten wir ausnutzen, um uns einen Insider zu verschaffen.§!

[l_japanese]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=空軍への潜入
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=§L[From.getAdjective]空軍は[From.GetAdjective]軍の中で最も日の浅い組織である。ゆえに空軍は、陸海軍ではありえないような、多数の変わった来歴の人々が様々な階級に据えられている。諜報員を浸透させるのに彼らのうちの誰かを利用できるだろう。§!

[l_korean]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=공군에 잠입
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=§L[From.getAdjective] 공군은 [From.GetAdjective]군 중 가장 늦게 창설되었습니다. 그러한 이유로, 그중에는 흔치 않은 배경을 가진 사람도 많습니다. 그들 중 일부를 활용한다면 내부 정보에 접근할 사람을 심을 수 있을 것입니다.§!

[l_polish]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=Infiltracja sił powietrznych
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=Siły powietrzne to najmłodszy rodzaj [From.GetAdjective] sił zbrojnych. Służy w nich wielu ludzi o niecodziennych życiorysach. Możemy to wykorzystać, żeby umieścić tam naszego agenta.

[l_russian]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=Внедрение в ВВС
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=§L[From.GetAdjective]ие ВВС — новейший род [From.GetAdjective]их войск, и потому в них служит много людей необычной биографии. Можно воспользоваться этим фактом, чтобы внедрить туда своего человека.§!

[l_simp_chinese]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=渗透空军
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=§L[From.getAdjective]空军是[From.GetAdjective]部队中最为年轻的战斗力量，因而有许多背景不凡的人在其中服役。也许我们可以从这些人之中发掘出我们的内应。§!

[l_spanish]
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce=Infiltrarse en la fuerza aérea
operation_infiltrate_armed_forces_airforce_desc=La fuerza aérea [From.getAdjective] es la más reciente de las fuerzas armadas [From.GetAdjective]. Por eso, en sus filas hay gente de orígenes inusuales. Podríamos aprovecharnos de esto para infiltrar a un hombre.
